  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what does Jesus say he will make Simon and Andrew?', 'Matthew 4:18-19', 'Walking by the sea of Galilee, he saw two brothers: Simon, who is called Peter, and Andrew, his brother, casting a net into the sea; for they were fishermen. He said to them, ''Come after me, and I will make you fishers for men.''', 'WEB', 1,
