  ((select id from w), 'multiple_choice', 'According to Matthew 5:21-22, what does Jesus say puts a person "in danger of the judgment," beyond the act of murder itself?', 'Matthew 5:21-22', 'You have heard that it was said to the ancient ones, ''You shall not murder... But I tell you that everyone who is angry with his brother without a cause will be in danger of the judgment.', 'WEB', 3,
