  ((select id from w), 'multiple_choice', 'According to Matthew 7:24-25, what did the wise man build his house on?', 'Matthew 7:24-25', 'Everyone therefore who hears these words of mine and does them, I will liken him to a wise man who built his house on the rock. The rain came down, the floods came, and the winds blew and beat on that house; and it didn''t fall, for it was founded on the rock.', 'WEB', 2,
