  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what quality of Jesus''s teaching astonished the multitudes?', 'Matthew 7:28-29', 'When Jesus had finished saying these things, the multitudes were astonished at his teaching, for he taught them with authority, and not like the scribes.', 'WEB', 2,
