  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what does Matthew''s fulfillment quotation say Jesus took, alongside bearing our diseases?', 'Matthew 8:16-17', 'When evening came, they brought to him many possessed with demons. He cast out the spirits with a word, and healed all who were sick, that it might be fulfilled which was spoken through Isaiah the prophet, saying, ''He took our infirmities and bore our diseases.''', 'WEB', 3,
