  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what does Jesus tell the paralyzed man about his sins?', 'Matthew 9:2', 'Behold, they brought to him a man who was paralyzed, lying on a bed. Jesus, seeing their faith, said to the paralytic, ''Son, cheer up! Your sins are forgiven you.''', 'WEB', 2,
