  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what did Jesus give his twelve disciples over unclean spirits?', 'Matthew 10:1', 'He called to himself his twelve disciples, and gave them authority over unclean spirits, to cast them out, and to heal every disease and every sickness.', 'WEB', 1,
