  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: in the parable of the sower, what kind of soil yielded a harvest?', 'Matthew 13:3-8', 'Behold, a farmer went out to sow. As he sowed, some seeds fell by the roadside, and the birds came and devoured them. Others fell on rocky ground... Others fell among thorns... Others fell on good soil and yielded fruit: some one hundred times as much, some sixty, and some thirty.', 'WEB', 2,
