  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what did the merchant find, of great price, that led him to sell everything?', 'Matthew 13:45-46', 'Again, the Kingdom of Heaven is like a man who is a merchant seeking fine pearls, who having found one pearl of great price, he went and sold all that he had and bought it.', 'WEB', 2,
